# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Release

How a version reaches users: numbering, signing, store submission, and what has to
be true first.

**Releases are never autonomous.** Every skill touching this document stops for an
explicit human decision, because a release is outward-facing and mostly
irreversible once distributed.

