## 3. Release checklist

- [ ] Version bumped, in every place it appears
- [ ] Changelog written from the decision log, not from `git log`
- [ ] Full test suite green on the release commit
- [ ] Build produced from a clean checkout of that commit
- [ ] Release notes reviewed by someone who did not write them
- [ ] Tag pushed **after** the artifact is accepted, not before

