**The policy belongs here; the running list does not.** If this project has a
`deprecations` role, the ledger of what is currently deprecated lives there and
this section holds only the process. Keeping the list here buries the rows a
consumer came for under policy they do not need — and produces two lists the
moment anyone adds the ledger later.

